WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.792
Delta tables add table behavior on top of data files.

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:11.962
They use a transaction log to track table changes and support more reliable operations than plain collections

00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:13.512
of files.

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:20.227
For this course, the key idea is that Delta tables make lakehouse data easier to query and manage

00:00:20.227 --> 00:00:25.952
as tables. A lakehouse combines scalable file-based storage with table-management features.

00:00:25.952 --> 00:00:34.782
Delta-style tables add transaction logs, schema controls, and reliable table operations on top of object

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:35.222
storage.

00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:42.352
Keep raw ingestion, cleaned data, and curated analytical tables conceptually separate so lineage remains

00:00:42.352 --> 00:00:42.822
clear.
